美政不？若豁然開懷，當知萬物之情也。」羲之遂報書曰：「吾素自無廊廟志，直王丞相時果欲內吾，誓不許之，手跡猶存，由來尚矣，不於足下參政而方進退。自兒娶女嫁，便懷尚子平之志，數與親知言之，非一日也。若蒙驅使，關隴、巴蜀皆所不辭。吾雖無專對之能，直謹守時命，宣國家威德，固當不同於凡使，必令遠近咸知朝廷留心於無外，此所益殊不同居護軍也。漢末使太傅馬日磾慰撫關東，若不以吾輕微，無所為疑，宜及初冬以行，吾惟恭以待命。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"庾亮","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"亮","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"殷浩","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0223","start":223,"end":226,"surface":"王丞相","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0266",